{"articleNo":"203132","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=203132&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [국제] 2019-2020 러시아 정부초청 장학생 선발 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.01.23","hit":"12959","attachments":[{"name":"Application form.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=203132&attachNo=79615"},{"name":"2019-2020 러시아정부초청 장학생 선발안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=203132&attachNo=79629"},{"name":"2019-2020 러시아 정부초청 장학생 지원자 명단.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=203132&attachNo=79678"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">2019-2020 러시아 정부초청 장학생을 아래와 같이 선발하오니 관심있는 학생 여러분의 많은 지원부탁드립니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">1. 선발과정: 학사, 석사, 박사</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">2. 장학금: 학비 지원(기숙</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">사, 항공료, 의료보험 등 기타비</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">용은 본인 부담)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">3. 선발인원: 20명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">4. 지원방법 및 기한</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">&nbsp; 가. 지원방법: 온라인 사이트 (</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><a href=\"http://russia.study/en\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525\">http://russia.study/en</span></a>)에 등록 후 직접 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;나. 지원기한: 2019. 2. 20.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5. 지원자격 및 제출서류: 첨부파일 참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">​</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움,Dotum; COLOR: #252525; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">문의: ​주한러시아대사관(02-318-2134)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
